prop rackpad on.use=sound||event:/exploring/obstacles/keypad/keypad_correct\nmessage||The keypad beeps. The last rack's locker opens.\nsignal||rackcode\ngive||story:rackcode*1
prop rackpad else.use=message||Four digits. The keepers used the control room's code for everything.
prop arkvalve on.use=signal||arkvalve\ngive||story:arkvalve*1\nsound||event:/exploring/temperence/ravine_collapse\ncamera|arkcam|racklights1|8|40\nmessage||The valve turns. Far off, the pumps take the strain, and the whole glacier groans over the Ark.\nshow|racklights3\nwait|2\nshow|racklights2\nwait|2\nshow|racklights1\nshow|gate\nshow|closingnote\nmessage||Down the halls the racks' lights come on, one hall after another. Behind them the ice gate slams shut for good.\nmessage||Hedda on the radio: Valve heard, Ark. That was Orrin's job, and you finished it for him. I am taking the Whale's launch south, toward the pulse. Keep talking.

